=2 Walkthrough
>**{c=red:Warning:}** **{p:Trust Magic} CANNOT be used in this BCNM.**
!Fei'Yin-map1.jpg|right|Map A
!Fei'Yin-map2.jpg|right|Map B
* Speak with {n:Gulmama} to obtain quest. If you are positive that you have the required fame but she is not allowing you to undertake this quest, continue speaking with her until her text changes. Once you have received the {p:key item|Key item}: {@k} {k:Tuning fork of ice}, you can now safely undertake the quest.
* Travel to {z:Beaucedine Glacier} and enter the ruins of {z:Fei'Yin} at (J-4). In Fei'Yin (Map A) travel to (G-9) and go down the stairs to the second map. In the basement (Map B) travel to (I-5) to find the entrance to the {z:Cloister of Frost}.
** Preferably, home point to {z:Fei'Yin} #2. If you don't have it yet, make sure to grab it on the way.
* Defeat {m:Shiva Prime} to receive the key item: {@k} {k:Whisper of frost}
* Return to {n:Gulmama} with the whisper and she will provide several reward options including the ability to summon {p:Shiva (Avatar)}.

=2 Notes
* Up to 6 party members can enter the arena.
* Each party member must have their own {@k} {k:Tuning fork of ice}
* Time limit is 30 minutes
* You can only select 1 of the rewards Gulmama offers at any time
* You may repeat this quest once per Earth day.
* You can save yourself a lot of time traveling to the {z:Cloister of Frost} by using the {@i:Mini Fork of Ice|1545} {i:Mini Fork of Ice|Mini Fork of Ice|1545} given by the quest {q:Trial-Size Trial by Ice|Trial-Size Trial by Ice|Trial-Size Trial by Ice}. You must be on {p:Summoner} as your main job, and obtain the Mini Tuning Fork from {n:Castilchat}, trade the fork back to {n:Castilchat}, but enter the **Protocrystal** normally. So long as you do not clear the level 20 version of the BC, you may warp to the {z:Cloister of Frost} as many times as you wish.
* You may also choose to retain the whisper in order to complete the requirements for this quest: {q:The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path|The Moonlit Path}

